Package: wsjtx-tools
Version: 1.5.0
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: W4MMP <w4mmp-ron@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-tk
Homepage: https://github.com/w4mmp-ron/wsjtx-tools
Description: WSJT-X helpers: HRDLog.net upload and local / DX decode window
 hrdlog-upload: a user service that watches the WSJT-X log and sends each
 new contact to HRDLog.net (callsign + upload code in
 ~/.config/hrdlog-upload.conf).
 .
 decode-split: a window (Ham Radio menu) that shows the WSJT-X decodes in two
 lists, local (your country or continent) and DX, with worked-before colours
 and legend, CQ / 73 filter, hide worked, clear each period, and double-click
 to call a station. Follows the WSJT-X UDP Server
 setting: 127.0.0.1 (default), or a multicast group such as 224.0.0.1 to share
 WSJT-X with other programs.
